# [#](#installation) Installation

## [#](#npm) npm

[![npm](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/chart.js.svg?style=flat-square&maxAge=600)  (opens new window)](https://npmjs.com/package/chart.js) [![npm](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/chart.js.svg?style=flat-square&maxAge=600)  (opens new window)](https://npmjs.com/package/chart.js)

```
npm install chart.js
```

